{"about_the_game":"<strong>WARBOUND</strong> combines strategic deckbuilding with epic kingdom conquest, delivering a captivating RTS experience. Build your base, assemble your battle deck, and lead powerful armies to conquer rival kingdoms in dynamic, real-time warfare. With every decision, the fate of your kingdom rests in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.poster.avif?t=1772627859\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.webm?t=1772627859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/3d81b37aed61a3dfbc6fd0bf14f232a4.mp4?t=1772627859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>Dynamic Deck Building</strong>: Collect and craft your ultimate deck with powerful army and potion cards. Choose your cards carefully\u2014each battle is a test of your strategy and skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.poster.avif?t=1772627859\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.webm?t=1772627859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119640/extras/8ae3e021083ca2c8557898c8aaadcdec.mp4?t=1772627859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Epic Kingdom Conquest</strong>: Invade rival kingdoms across varied landscapes. Strategize your approach, deploy your King, and crush your enemies in intens